    "description": "Objective\n\nFix the \"POC SLC - After Save - Player, DRA and Sign Up\" flow so the Update Study Link Click element writes the resolved Deal's Id into Related_Deal\\__c (lookup to Deal_\\_c), not the Deal-Rep Assignment's Id, which currently throws a FIELD_INTEGRITY_EXCEPTION.\n\nImplementation Requirements\n\nLocate the \"Update Study Link Click\" element in the flow\n\nRepoint the Related_Deal\\__c assignment to the Deal resolved from the Deal-Rep Assignment (e.g. {DRA}.Deal_\\_c), not the DRA record itself\n\nConfirm the unknown-rep / review-required branch (which currently avoids the bug) is unaffected by the fix\n\nAcceptance Criteria\n\nA Study Link Click that resolves an active Deal-Rep Assignment completes without error\n\nRelated_Deal__c on the resulting record correctly references the Deal, not the Deal-Rep Assignment\n\nTesting Notes\n\nRe-run all 6 queued sample Study Link Click test records after the fix (see POC-24). Prior test transaction rolled back cleanly with no orphan records.\n\nOut of Scope\n\nN/A — hotfix only\n\n\\----------------------------------------\n\nEstimate: XXS · \\~1-2h · Dependencies: None · Ticket POC-17 (approved 2026-07-07)\n\nSource: Identified during internal Salesforce build work, 2026-07-07, ahead of the 7/8 client review.",
